# Project change rules

Follow these on every change:

- Do NOT modify, rename, move, re-encode, resize, or remove any image files, `<img>` tags, `src`/`srcset` attributes, logo files, existing text content, or the base64 image in `studentoutcomes.html`. Assume all images exist.
- Keep changes minimal and limited to the files named in the task.
- Do not delete code unless the task says "delete".
- After each task, list the files changed and what you verified.
